# --- Secrets (repo is public) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Impeccable design artifacts ---
# Only Pemby's own approved comps are tracked, plus every JSON sidecar (a sidecar records an
# approval, so it is project truth). Every other comp is a spent round: kept locally, never in
# public history. Nothing third-party is published, whatever it was used for.
#
# The scratch patterns below are `**/`-prefixed because an `.impeccable/` directory appears both
# at the repo root and inside an app (`apps/web/.impeccable/`). A pattern with a slash in the
# middle anchors to this file's directory, so an unprefixed `.impeccable/review/` silently misses
# every per-app copy.
.impeccable/mocks/*.png
!.impeccable/mocks/band-light.png
!.impeccable/mocks/band-dark.png
# The two owner-approved comps (2026-09-21). PRODUCT.md names them as the binding visual record,
# so every clone has to have them. Generated by us, so they are ours to publish.
!.impeccable/mocks/pin-landing.png
!.impeccable/mocks/pin-brief.png

# Rejected direction round
**/.impeccable/mocks/decision/

# Local decision-page server state (session scratch, not project truth)
**/.impeccable/questions/

# Build/review state produced during a comp-led build
**/.impeccable/build/
**/.impeccable/review/

# Machine-local impeccable overrides
**/.impeccable/config.local.json

# --- OS noise ---
.DS_Store

# Third-party reference screenshots (kept local, never published)
docs/research/desertant/

# --- Dependencies and build output ---
node_modules/
.next/
.turbo/
dist/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
.vercel/
# Generated by Next.js on dev/build/typegen (Next docs recommend ignoring it)
next-env.d.ts

# Agent worktrees (local only)
.claude/worktrees/

# Eligibility eval: cached candidate pulls and API responses (local only)
eval/.cache/
